(text "POLARITY / PIN IDENTIFICATION" (at 15 167 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3dfbe790-bbe4-482b-bf31-345e2b33f7cb"))
(text "D1: pin 1 = A (battery side); pin 2 = K / band (protected supply).\nD2: pin 1 = K / band (protected supply); pin 2 = A (GND).\nC1: pin 1 = positive (DIVIDER_NODE); pin 2 = negative (GND).\nU1: pin 1 = input; pin 2 = GND; pin 3 = +5V output.\nU3.J2 / U3.J3 are HELTEC headers; schematic J2 is the SENSOR\nconnector, and schematic J3 is the RF PIGTAIL. Do not confuse them." (at 15 177 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7) ) (justify left top)) (uuid "69219702-161c-49f0-bd5f-323c5aeda084"))
(text "EXTERNAL WIRE DESTINATIONS" (at 210 177 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "85bd887f-d034-4a5d-9c34-448e62297f73"))
(text "Battery +12V → J1.1; battery negative → J1.2.\nWindSonic J2.2 supply+ → PROTECTED_12V.\nWindSonic J2.3 supply− → GND.\nWindSonic J2.4 TXD+ → U2.R+; J2.5 TXD− → U2.R−.\nWindSonic J2.1 signal ground → U2.RGND (separate from GND).\nRF: Heltec LoRa IPEX → J3.1; J3.2 → AE1.1.\nU2.TXD USED; RXD UNUSED. TTL data is the module-to-Heltec connection, not RS-422." (at 210 187 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7) ) (justify left top)) (uuid "796382af-fc5d-4398-ab7d-8e3f810d2245"))
(polyline (pts (xy 15 221) (xy 405 221)) (stroke (width 0.4) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "0c87d4c6-0861-464d-8dd7-326f29f64d9d"))
(text "ASSEMBLY LIMITS — RESOLVE BEFORE USING AS A PHYSICAL PLACEMENT GUIDE" (at 15 227 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7035c61a-fdb2-4a8d-b3fc-6892ae2057f3"))
(text "No physical board layout, pad map, hole spacing, component locations or Heltec mounting orientation is established by the schematic.\nThe Heltec box is a logical module view, NOT a top/bottom view or a header-position drawing. Connector mating/view direction is unspecified.\nConfirm those physical details against the actual board before soldering; this document deliberately assigns no new pads or jumpers.\nConnector part numbers, resistor tolerances/power ratings, capacitor voltage ratings, U2 termination setting and RF pigtail part number remain unresolved.\nUnused: WindSonic J2 pins 6–9; U2 T+, T− and RXD (UNUSED). Do not wire them. No additional power or ground connections are implied.\nGPIO2 battery sensing is retained exactly as drawn. This assembly aid makes no hardware corrections or redesigns." (at 15 237 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7) ) (justify left top)) (uuid "ca665911-c73b-4f35-af3f-d1c864784902"))
(polyline (pts (xy 15 282) (xy 405 282)) (stroke (width 0.3) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "b536e78c-8848-4edd-a421-a1092eafe28b"))
